{:strongs 5234, :hebrew "הכר", :lang :zh-Hans, :gloss "properly, to scrutinize, i.e. look intently at; hence (with recognition implied), to acknowledge, be acquainted with, care for, respect, revere, or (with suspicion implied), to disregard, ignore, be strange toward, reject, resign, dissimulate (as if ignorant or disowning)", :text "本义为仔细察看,即凝视、注视;由此 (隐含辨认之意) 承认、熟知、眷顾、尊重、敬畏,或 (隐含猜疑之意) 不顾、忽略、对……感到陌生、拒绝、放弃、伪装 (如同不认识或不承认)", :model "glm-5.2", :timestamp "2026-07-27T02:05:27.197559522Z"}